Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||06-04-2001||03:32 PM||||picked my dad up from the autobody shop he was dropping the minivan off at, and on the way home theres this white lowered tinted farty cavalier next to us at a light. i do my normal econo driving, shifting at 2500 out of the light, and he starts farting off all over the place and pulls ahead of us. My dad looks and me and says "alright, fine..." so i pull up next to him at the next light, and while we are waiting, we formulate a plan... the light turns green, and the plan springs into action - vroom - first gear to 3000, burrrr.... vroom! 3rd gear to 3000, burrrrrrrrrrrrr (5th gear at 1000 rpm crawling up) all the while, my dad with his hand out the window displaying what gear we were in... (1st was hilarious) took him by about 6 car lengths on a half mile stretch of road - w/ 220lb me, 340lb dad, and a trunk full of computer equipment and ac on. he turned around a corner and never looked back - there was a guy in a f 150 and his girlfriend clapping and laughing at the next light... it was great||||reg||1
