Z||000002||Seanh||06-04-2001||07:35 PM||||Reminds me of a Saturday night a couple weeks ago. I had 4 people in my car. I was driving, sitting as close to the door as physically possible, Chris was standing up in the drivers seat, head out the sunroof. Brandon was standing on the passenger seat, head also out the sunroof. And Nic was in my situation, on the passenger side. These kids in their new 94 V6 Camaro (same engine as in my Fiero) pull up next to us and start laughing at us for having all those people in my little car. So everyone starts encouraging me to race them, since I didn't want to because of everyone in my car. But I did. Mines an auto, so I just pushed it to the floor, and watched their dissapointment in my rearview mirror (well not really, I couldn't see out of it). Needless to say, they didn't even look at us the rest of night.||||reg||1
